                "content": "StartCollaborativeBuild\n  ├─ Generate sessionId\n  ├─ Save to DB\n  └─ Execute: SpawnWorkers (pass taskDivision too)\n      ↓\nSpawnWorkers\n  ├─ Spawn workers (workerCount: 3)\n  ├─ Append to spawnedWorkers array\n  └─ Execute: WaitAndRegister (pass taskDivision)\n      ↓\nWaitAndRegister\n  ├─ Wait for workers ready\n  ├─ Register workers\n  └─ Execute: CoordinateBuild (pass taskDivision)\n      ↓\nCoordinateBuild\n  ├─ Create session\n  ├─ Get position\n  ├─ Reserve location\n  ├─ Teleport workers\n  └─ Execute: DistributeTasks (pass taskDivision) ← HERE!\n      ↓\nDistributeTasks\n  ├─ Function: Convert taskDivision to array\n  ├─ Loop through tasks\n  ├─ HTTP POST send-task to each worker\n  └─ Complete"
